        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-14T00:07:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"XChylde\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/xchylde/48/2559_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> XChylde:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Do we know if the art for Legacy is going to be standard SotM or more in line with Devastation? &nbsp;It would be nice to have him in the Devastation style for uniform style of the game and I always like seeing different artist interpretations.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I actually asked Brad about this during one of those live drawing things they've been doing. His response was that he prefers having the promo art done by the original artist, so either they'll have stock art they'll use for the character or if Adam had the free time for him to supply art.</p>",
