        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lcinn/{size}/2659_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-16T09:30:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, I believe you may ask to look into your opponents hand and discard at any time before either of you play your cards for the turn. The entire idea of the game is that you have perfect information, save for that little pesky bit of info: what is he/she going to do this turn?</p>",
