        "created_at": "2013-01-16T21:19:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That makes sense, but the rules and comic don't explain that very clearly.&nbsp; It is especially important to understand how that works with the character that guesses which base his opponent uses during the ante phase.</p>",
